{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22672","headline":"春夜喜雪有怀王二十二 · 白居易","name":"春夜喜雪有怀王二十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜雪有佳趣，幽人出书帷。\n微寒生枕席，轻素对阶墀。\n坐罢楚弦曲，起吟班扇诗。\n明宜灭烛後，净爱褰帘时。\n窗引曙色早，庭销春气迟。\n山阴应有兴，不卧待徽之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}